  "description": "With her fierce eyes and sharp impression, and wary of everyone, 'Ahn Se-young' is a woman to watch out for. Everyone is cautious around her, but a lone boy stands in front of her.  \n\"I like you, go out with me!\"  \n\"...What?!\"  \nSe-young is taken aback at the sudden confession of love, but this was just the beginning...  \nThe tug-of-war between 'Ahn Se-young', who shows an unexpected side to her as you get closer, and 'Nam Ho-yeol', the straightforward guy who tries to break down her impenetrable facade, begins now!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sharpeyes)",
